Date: Sun, 1 Mar 2026 09:18:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 191/244] Track the last active user session for accurate
 response routing

Updated `ceo-proxy.cjs` to track `lastUserSessionKey` from chat events. Modified `getActiveSessionKey` to use this new key as the primary fallback for routing worker results, ensuring responses are sent to the session where the user is actively interacting. Also updated script versions in `model-config.html`, `processes.html`, and `workers.html`.

